Node ID=1 the heir challenges you
Text=Stop there, morsel. <Red bows rise all around you.> I am Hrargrub, son of Butu Khan, and Khan after him by right. This cave is mine. The east rock is mine. Soon the Warrens will be mine, and Plumdjum will learn whose chair he has been warming. Speak carefully. I am deciding whether you are useful or dinner.
Should Have Voiceover=0

