Node ID=60 who was butu
Text=Khan of this horde, before Plumdjum. Plumdjum took the Warrens from him, and took his book of poems as a trophy, to show the clan who rules now. My father's goblins followed me to this cave. We have waited six winters. We are done waiting.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do you want from me?
Go to node ID=90 the book
