------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=90 the book
Text=Butu's book of poems. Plumdjum keeps it in the Warrens with his gold and does not know what it is. Humans in the city buy such things by weight. Bring it to me, and this cave is yours to walk.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Has Butu Khan Poetry Book
Reply Text=I have it here.
